#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsHelp.php:66
msgid "Lingua Forge Settings"
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsHelp.php:67
msgid "Lingua Forge adds multilingual routing, AI-powered translation, hreflang SEO tags, and a language switcher to your WordPress site."
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsHelp.php:68
msgid "Use the tabs across the top of this page to configure each area. Changes to the Router tab take effect immediately; changes to AI keys and model settings apply to the next AI request."
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsHelp.php:69
msgid "After changing URL structure settings (path prefix ↔ subdomain), always visit Settings → Permalinks and click Save Changes to flush the rewrite rules."
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsHelp.php:75
msgid "Router Tab"
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsHelp.php:76
msgid "Primary language: the language your existing content is written in. All translations are produced from this language; changing it does not move or delete any posts."
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsHelp.php:77
msgid "URL structure: path-prefix mode (example.com/de/) requires no server changes. Subdomain mode (de.example.com) requires a wildcard DNS record, a wildcard SSL certificate, and a web server configuration change — see the Server Setup guide."
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsHelp.php:78
msgid "Active languages: add each language you want to support. Each language gets a URL prefix or subdomain and an hreflang tag in the page &lt;head&gt;."
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsHelp.php:79
msgid "FSE localisation: scaffold, translate, and fix links in Full Site Editing templates and template parts directly from this tab."
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsHelp.php:85
msgid "API Keys Tab"
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsHelp.php:86
msgid "Enter your API key for at least one AI provider. Keys are encrypted at rest using AES-256-GCM with a site-specific secret (LINGUAFORGE_SECRET). Do not share database exports without rotating the secret first."
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsHelp.php:87
msgid "Supported providers: Anthropic (Claude), OpenAI (GPT), Google (Gemini). Only one provider is active at a time. Select the active provider on the General tab."
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsHelp.php:88
msgid "AI features are optional. Language routing, hreflang, the language switcher, and the translation group system all work without a provider configured."
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsHelp.php:94
msgid "Models Tab (General)"
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsHelp.php:95
msgid "Lingua Forge uses two model tiers per provider:"
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsHelp.php:96
msgid "Light: used for meta descriptions and excerpt generation — fast, low cost."
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsHelp.php:97
msgid "Quality: used for post translation and content generation — higher quality, higher cost."
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsHelp.php:98
msgid "Leave a model field blank to use the built-in default for that tier. The placeholder text shows which model will be used."
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsHelp.php:102
msgid "Translation"
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsHelp.php:104
msgid "Translation Limits & Behavior"
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsHelp.php:105
msgid "Translation Limits: control which user roles can trigger AI translation, and set a monthly token budget. Exceeding the budget suspends AI calls until the month resets."
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsHelp.php:106
msgid "Behavior: choose the AI preset (Literal, Balanced, Creative), add site-wide custom prompt instructions, enable or disable automatic post-save translation, and configure the Translation Memory."
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsHelp.php:107
msgid "Translation Memory caches AI results by content hash, language pair, provider, and model. Editing a post invalidates the cache entry so the next translate call gets a fresh result."
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsHelp.php:113
msgid "Glossary Tab"
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsHelp.php:114
msgid "Pin terms that must not be translated or must always be rendered in a specific way (e.g. brand names, product names, acronyms). Glossary constraints are injected into every AI translation request for all features: post translation, meta description, excerpt, and FSE template translation."
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsHelp.php:115
msgid "Add one term per row. Both the source term and the target rendering are required. The language pair determines which translation jobs the constraint applies to."
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsHelp.php:121
msgid "Maintenance Tab"
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsHelp.php:122
msgid "AI Cache: lists cached AI responses with hit counts. Clear the whole cache or a single post's entries. Use \"Clear\" before testing a translation change — cached results are returned even when you change the AI preset or model until the cache entry is evicted."
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsHelp.php:123
msgid "Translation Memory: stores the full translated post per content hash. Clear it when you want to force a retranslation of all posts regardless of whether their content changed."
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsHelp.php:124
msgid "Language Overrides: manage custom .po/.mo override files for the Lingua Forge UI strings. Use this instead of editing plugin files directly — overrides survive updates."
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsHelp.php:125
msgid "Debug: enable the debug log to capture AI prompts and API responses to a local file. Disable after troubleshooting — debug mode writes a file on every AI request."
msgstr ""

